sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Admin as Administrateur (Angular)
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant ST as station-service
    participant DB as station_db (PostgreSQL)
    participant RL as Releves
    participant PV as Previsions
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ

    Note over RL,ST: SYNCHRONE (OpenFeign) - verifier qu'une station existe
    RL->>ST: GET /api/stations/{id}
    ST->>DB: SELECT station
    alt station trouvee
        ST-->>RL: 200 OK -> releve enregistre
    else station absente
        ST-->>RL: 404 Not Found -> releve refuse
    else station-service indisponible
        RL-->>RL: circuit breaker -> fallback
    end

    Note over PV,ST: SYNCHRONE (OpenFeign) - recuperer les coordonnees
    PV->>ST: GET /api/stations/{id}
    ST-->>PV: 200 OK (latitude, longitude)
    Note over PV: si indisponible : fallback (circuit breaker)

    Note over Admin,MQ: ASYNCHRONE (RabbitMQ) - suppression d'une station
    Admin->>GW: DELETE /api/stations/{id} (JWT ADMIN)
    GW->>ST: DELETE /api/stations/{id}
    ST->>DB: UPDATE active = false
    ST-->>GW: 204 No Content
    ST-)MQ: publie StationDeactivated (station.deactivated)
